WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.240
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:13.510 --> 00:15.476
MISSION CAPTURE THE MASTERMIND.

3
00:17.506 --> 00:19.383
MISSION COMMIT MURDER.

4
00:21.510 --> 00:23.387
MISSION CLEAR THE CHECKPOINTS WITHIN THE TIME LIMITS AND REACH THE GOAL.

5
00:25.515 --> 00:27.391
MISSION

6
00:29.519 --> 00:31.395
MISSION

7
00:32.831 --> 00:34.916
5 CONTESTANTS LEFT.

8
00:34.941 --> 00:39.570
7 DAYS AND 4 HOURS UNTIL THE GAME ENDS.

9
00:43.156 --> 00:47.009
TOKYO PM 03:02 JST

10
00:51.494 --> 00:52.247
Yes?

11
00:53.162 --> 00:57.792
The body of Dao Saetang, who was kidnapped in Bangkok,

12
00:57.917 --> 01:00.002
has been discovered.

13
01:00.298 --> 01:02.056
Another person was killed.

14
01:03.506 --> 01:07.556
I don't know what I should be doing at a time like this.

15
01:08.219 --> 01:11.097
I don't know if this is right either.

16
01:12.139 --> 01:16.852
But I know that Saori would say this...

17
01:18.979 --> 01:20.648
"Rescue everyone."

18
01:34.662 --> 01:38.833
As long as the game continues, there will be casualties.

19
01:41.001 --> 01:43.681
If one person succeeds, the rest will die.

20
01:46.131 --> 01:50.584
It's a sick, twisted game...

21
01:56.642 --> 01:59.816
-That's why I'm going to Seoul. -Seoul?

22
02:01.605 --> 02:04.191
The player there is in a bad situation.

23
02:04.442 --> 02:08.929
Seoul... You're meeting the girl's father, Han Kiju the doctor, right?

24
02:09.804 --> 02:10.875
Yeah.

25
02:11.866 --> 02:13.367
SEOUL

26
02:13.492 --> 02:16.203
PM 03:10 KST

27
02:17.413 --> 02:20.791
I WILL SOLVE THIS CASE AND SAVE EVERYONE MIXED UP IN IT. INCLUDING YOU.

28
02:23.753 --> 02:26.297
Including me...?

29
02:29.049 --> 02:30.801
He's not replying!

30
02:32.219 --> 02:34.013
-Replying? -Look!

31
02:40.352 --> 02:44.106
It's nothing. Just enjoy your meal.

32
02:53.032 --> 02:54.700
I told you, it's a prank.

33
02:54.825 --> 02:57.328
People are being killed!

34
03:01.916 --> 03:02.833
Keep it down.

35
03:02.958 --> 03:07.463
Everyone's saying they were killed in the kiDnap GAME!

36
03:07.838 --> 03:10.925
Another kiDnap GAME death.

37
03:11.884 --> 03:13.427
What's going on?

38
03:17.640 --> 03:21.727
Did he reply to you?

39
03:23.771 --> 03:24.980
-Show me. -Calm down.

40
03:25.189 --> 03:27.525
Show me! Give it to me!

41
03:27.650 --> 03:30.486
-I have to get to Rian! -Let go!

42
03:30.653 --> 03:32.029
Ayun! Stop!

43
03:34.240 --> 03:36.534
Ayun?! You all right?

44
03:46.252 --> 03:47.461
Murderer...

45
03:49.713 --> 03:54.593
You robbed Rian of her sight.

46
03:57.596 --> 03:59.682
Now you're leaving her to die.

47
04:18.325 --> 04:20.035
I'm being forced to play.

48
04:25.916 --> 04:28.544
YOU HAVE BEEN ENLISTED IN THE KIDNAP GAME.

49
04:29.211 --> 04:30.546
My mission...

50
04:32.423 --> 04:34.383
is to commit murder.

51
05:09.209 --> 05:12.755
KIDNAP GAME

52
05:15.716 --> 05:17.676
"Commit murder"?

53
05:19.678 --> 05:20.721
Yes.

54
05:23.182 --> 05:28.103
If you kill someone, will that save Rian?

55
05:31.148 --> 05:34.950
It fulfils the mission, so yes.

56
05:41.742 --> 05:44.828
Rian's going to be all right, isn't she?

57
05:48.207 --> 05:51.210
You'll kill someone to save her, right?

58
05:55.089 --> 05:56.548
You're her father!

59
05:57.383 --> 05:59.885
Rian was kidnapped in front of you!

60
06:01.929 --> 06:03.514
Why hesitate?!

61
06:03.639 --> 06:06.016
Whatever it takes, do it!

62
06:11.146 --> 06:15.234
Would you be able to kill someone if they told you to?

63
06:15.359 --> 06:16.694
I would.

64
06:20.114 --> 06:21.198
What?

65
06:21.323 --> 06:24.576
I'd do anything for her. I'm her parent.

66
06:24.702 --> 06:28.580
Rian's my child. I'd even commit murder...

67
06:48.350 --> 06:51.270
The person I admire the most is my dad.

68
06:51.353 --> 06:51.895
5 YEARS AGO

69
06:51.895 --> 06:54.189
He is a doctor.

70
06:54.314 --> 06:58.235
My dad's job is saving people's lives.

71
06:58.736 --> 07:03.532
I want to become someone who can save people, just like him.

72
07:09.788 --> 07:14.126
It's thanks to you that she's grown to be such a good girl.

73
07:15.085 --> 07:20.174
It's a nice memory to have before I leave Seoul.

74
07:20.716 --> 07:24.011
Call Rian from Japan from time to time, okay?

75
07:24.136 --> 07:27.431
I'll call every day. If there's time.

76
07:29.349 --> 07:31.977
You know...

77
07:32.603 --> 07:38.192
Lately Rian's been saying from time to time that her eyes get blurry.

78
07:39.109 --> 07:42.905
I'll talk to the hospital. Have them run some tests.

79
07:45.741 --> 07:48.452
TOKYO GENERAL MEDICAL CENTER

80
07:48.786 --> 07:50.537
A brain tumor?!

81
07:52.915 --> 07:56.543
She might not only go blind. She may even die.

82
07:57.628 --> 07:59.129
No...

83
07:59.254 --> 08:03.175
Please, you have to save her!

84
08:03.675 --> 08:10.182
Yes, of course. I'll return to Seoul at once. I'll make sure she pulls through this.

85
08:10.516 --> 08:13.227
OPERATING CENTER

86
08:14.103 --> 08:16.688
It's right behind the optic nerve.

87
08:35.415 --> 08:37.751
Will she go blind?

88
08:39.336 --> 08:41.296
You said it would succeed...

89
08:45.884 --> 08:48.136
That you'd fix her eyes...

90
09:00.482 --> 09:04.486
Dad, did you quit being a doctor?

91
09:04.611 --> 09:05.696
2 YEARS AGO

92
09:06.029 --> 09:08.157
No, I didn't quit.

93
09:09.491 --> 09:13.245
But you're at home all the time now.

94
09:15.247 --> 09:17.040
Ah, you see,

95
09:17.332 --> 09:23.964
I work part-time, only when the hospital needs me.

96
09:24.882 --> 09:26.300
I'm glad.

97
09:29.177 --> 09:34.663
I love how you're a doctor who saves people.

98
09:40.564 --> 09:41.899
Is that right?

99
09:59.583 --> 10:03.128
I WILL SOLVE THIS CASE AND SAVE EVERYONE MIXED UP IN IT.

100
10:03.253 --> 10:06.173
INCLUDING YOU.

101
10:13.096 --> 10:17.434
SHINJUKU CENTRAL POLICE STATION

102
10:18.769 --> 10:21.150
-Get in. -Akina? Where are we going?

103
10:21.230 --> 10:23.482
-Just c'mon. -Okay.

104
10:24.650 --> 10:25.430
Excuse me.

105
10:30.072 --> 10:32.908
Niide asked me to contact you.

106
10:33.033 --> 10:34.368
Niide?!

107
10:35.202 --> 10:38.872
But I've been suspended for two weeks.

108
10:39.289 --> 10:42.751
He predicted that was going to happen.

109
10:42.960 --> 10:44.378
What do you mean?

110
10:44.753 --> 10:49.049
Niide has to capture the Mastermind. Without the police.

111
10:49.174 --> 10:52.219
Technically, you're not a police officer on duty.

112
11:01.520 --> 11:03.480
TEITO TELEVISION

113
11:04.106 --> 11:06.233
Niide wants you to find him.

114
11:07.484 --> 11:10.779
-Who is he? -He's involved in the kidnappings.

115
11:10.904 --> 11:14.533
He was there during the bomb scare at the hospital.

116
11:14.658 --> 11:17.170
The firecrackers incident Niide was at?

117
11:19.288 --> 11:22.476
Everything we know so far is in here.

118
11:25.752 --> 11:29.381
All right. By the way, where's Niide?

119
11:29.506 --> 11:32.092
-Off to Seoul. -Seoul?

120
11:32.938 --> 11:36.656
A doctor there is planning a murder to complete his mission.

121
11:37.264 --> 11:38.724
Niide's gone to look for him.

122
11:38.849 --> 11:43.311
Wait, so he's going to the airport?! That's a bad idea.

123
11:43.645 --> 11:46.982
The SIT is there. Inspector Samejima set a trap.

124
11:49.401 --> 11:52.279
That's why Niide's gone to Fukuoka.

125
11:53.363 --> 11:55.157
-Fukuoka? -The Busan ferry.

126
11:55.907 --> 12:00.746
It's a detour, but chances are it's off their radar.

127
12:03.689 --> 12:07.264
A QUIET LIFE AFTER HANGING UP THE SCALPEL

128
12:08.003 --> 12:12.007
I will complete my mission and save Rian by any means possible.

129
13:03.350 --> 13:04.357
Why hesitate?!

130
13:05.060 --> 13:07.729
Whatever it takes, do it!

131
13:28.667 --> 13:30.001
I'm sorry...

132
13:34.381 --> 13:35.549
I'm so...

133
13:54.776 --> 13:55.423
Dr. Han?

134
14:00.657 --> 14:01.491
Oh, hello.

135
14:02.451 --> 14:03.535
What are you doing?

136
14:05.620 --> 14:06.991
I, uh...

137
14:08.039 --> 14:11.096
I know this patient. I came to see how she's doing.

138
14:12.169 --> 14:14.983
What about you?

139
14:17.340 --> 14:23.555
There's an operation scheduled for tomorrow, but the surgeon came down with a fever.

140
14:23.680 --> 14:27.767
Trying to find a replacement but nobody's available.

141
14:28.602 --> 14:29.656
Is that so?

142
14:31.229 --> 14:33.470
I'm sorry that I can't help.

143
14:56.046 --> 15:01.051
DANGER: HIGH-CONCENTRATION DRUG

144
15:37.087 --> 15:38.922
-Come on. -Let me go!

145
15:39.047 --> 15:42.133
Come here!

146
15:42.592 --> 15:43.802
Whiskey highball.

147
15:45.554 --> 15:46.721
You're hurting me!

148
15:46.846 --> 15:49.599
Let's drink somewhere else, just us.

149
15:49.724 --> 15:52.602
I'm not interested. Get lost, asshole.

150
15:52.727 --> 15:54.187
What a charmer.

151
15:54.312 --> 15:57.315
Were you leading me on just now or what?

152
15:57.440 --> 15:58.483
-Me? -Yeah, you!

153
15:58.542 --> 16:01.086
-When was I leading you on? -Just now.

154
16:04.155 --> 16:07.450
-Stay put. I'm talking to you. -That hurts!

155
16:07.576 --> 16:09.869
Come off it. Stay put.

156
16:09.995 --> 16:11.246
Let go.

157
16:11.830 --> 16:14.791
-No. Let's talk outside. -Talk about what?!

158
16:18.169 --> 16:19.754
I'd even commit murder...

159
16:20.130 --> 16:21.881
I wanna talk to you.

160
16:22.173 --> 16:25.383
-About what? -You'll find out if you listen.

161
16:25.469 --> 16:28.356
-Why should I? -I wanna talk.

162
16:28.471 --> 16:30.181
Let go, you creep!

163
16:31.576 --> 16:33.496
Bitch!

164
16:59.462 --> 17:00.880
What the hell?!

165
17:02.974 --> 17:04.355
Get back here!

166
17:27.697 --> 17:29.407
I can't do it.

167
17:57.769 --> 17:59.436
What am I supposed to do?!

168
18:02.482 --> 18:04.976
What am I supposed to do?!

169
18:19.541 --> 18:20.821
Are you trying to kill someone?

170
18:30.677 --> 18:34.390
The kiDnap GAME. Is your mission "murder"?

171
18:41.730 --> 18:47.193
You're with them, aren't you!

172
18:47.318 --> 18:50.613
Give her back! Give Rian back!

173
18:54.117 --> 18:59.297
You want murder? You got it!

174
19:01.332 --> 19:03.916
You mustn't... I'm not the kidnapper.

175
19:18.349 --> 19:23.688
Then why do you appear around me? Why do you follow me around?

176
19:25.064 --> 19:26.711
I'm worried about you.

177
19:28.359 --> 19:29.778
Seven years ago,

178
19:30.528 --> 19:32.766
you saved my brother.

179
19:36.326 --> 19:38.661
He was a worthless vagrant,

180
19:40.955 --> 19:44.000
lying in the gutter.

181
19:45.335 --> 19:47.754
Yet you did everything to save him.

182
19:51.216 --> 19:52.592
I don't remember.

183
19:52.717 --> 19:54.928
To you, saving a life is normal.

184
19:56.429 --> 20:00.036
Which is why for you, murder is impossible.

185
20:13.947 --> 20:17.230
Then what?! What am I supposed to do?

186
20:20.411 --> 20:21.830
There's no other way!

187
20:25.375 --> 20:26.188
No other way...

188
20:39.722 --> 20:40.890
Doctor...

189
21:03.788 --> 21:04.803
Long day?

190
21:06.583 --> 21:08.949
Work.

191
21:11.588 --> 21:14.016
I was worried. You left work a while ago.

192
21:14.882 --> 21:17.903
It took you a long time to get home.

193
21:20.638 --> 21:21.830
What are you worried about?

194
21:24.183 --> 21:25.727
The kiDnap GAME.

195
21:28.271 --> 21:30.064
Haven't you heard of it?

196
21:33.234 --> 21:34.777
It's just a rumor.

197
21:35.653 --> 21:37.223
If it were true,

198
21:38.072 --> 21:42.403
then you or your wife would also be in that game, wouldn't you?

199
21:45.288 --> 21:47.540
If I were in the game,

200
21:47.916 --> 21:51.127
I wouldn't be drinking here, would I?!

201
21:51.544 --> 21:52.879
Kiju.

202
21:55.965 --> 21:57.483
You need to rest, dear.

203
22:00.094 --> 22:01.636
Good night.

204
22:18.237 --> 22:19.496
Weren't you able to do it?

205
22:23.076 --> 22:24.327
No. Sorry.

206
22:31.501 --> 22:32.794
Kill me.

207
22:34.253 --> 22:35.171
What?

208
22:35.630 --> 22:37.583
Isn't your mission to kill?

209
22:40.635 --> 22:43.054
Are you crazy? I can't kill you.

210
22:43.763 --> 22:45.807
Kill me... Just kill me!

211
22:47.892 --> 22:49.060
No!

212
22:52.230 --> 22:53.773
So...

213
22:56.693 --> 22:58.611
You're going to let Rian die?

214
23:00.697 --> 23:02.615
Someone has to die.

215
23:03.825 --> 23:05.743
You have a choice.

216
23:07.078 --> 23:09.247
Does Rian die?

217
23:10.157 --> 23:11.002
Do I die?

218
23:12.166 --> 23:13.263
Or does a stranger die?

219
23:21.884 --> 23:23.396
There's no need to kill you.

220
23:27.223 --> 23:28.156
I've made up my mind.

221
23:30.116 --> 23:34.170
I'll operate tomorrow.

222
23:44.032 --> 23:45.949
I put down my scalpel...

223
23:51.164 --> 23:52.523
because of these hands.

224
23:55.585 --> 23:59.743
When I stand at the operating table, my fingers start to shake...

225
24:03.634 --> 24:04.876
I'm scared I'll mess up...

226
24:08.008 --> 24:08.996
Like with Rian...

227
24:12.310 --> 24:13.896
That operation was a success.

228
24:19.233 --> 24:19.856
But...

229
24:22.612 --> 24:25.870
Rian lost her sight.

230
24:26.991 --> 24:29.703
I took the light from her world.

231
24:32.997 --> 24:39.523
I failed the one person I had to save over anyone else.

232
24:55.978 --> 25:01.651
Tomorrow, my hands are sure to shake...

233
25:04.987 --> 25:06.948
The surgery will fail.

234
25:10.576 --> 25:12.912
Because of me...

235
25:20.336 --> 25:25.550
The patient will die.

236
25:34.350 --> 25:37.603
KIDNAP GAME DAY 4

237
25:40.247 --> 25:43.550
AM 08:07 JST

238
25:46.445 --> 25:48.573
WHAT DOES THIS MEAN?

239
25:48.698 --> 25:54.495
I’LL HELP YOU IF YOU CAN SOLVE IT. I THINK IT’S A PLACE IN SINGAPORE…

240
25:54.579 --> 25:55.288
SINGAPORE

241
25:55.329 --> 25:58.040
25 250...

242
25:58.416 --> 26:01.303
What is this? I don’t get it...

243
26:02.420 --> 26:05.990
25 250...

244
26:08.197 --> 26:12.118
Oh, no. Only three hours left...

245
26:19.437 --> 26:22.773
"Isn’t that the treetop walk at MacRitchie Reservoir?

246
26:22.899 --> 26:28.362
"It’s a suspension bridge 25m high and 250m long."

247
26:29.822 --> 26:32.199
Yes! That must be it!

248
26:33.910 --> 26:36.370
Sorry, sorry, sorry...

249
26:37.747 --> 26:41.667
Hi! Wait! I'm coming!

250
26:41.792 --> 26:45.046
Oh my God! Wait for me, wait for me!

251
27:02.413 --> 27:05.930
SHOULD YOU REALLY BE HELPING ME? WE’RE ENEMIES.

252
27:05.983 --> 27:09.320
CONSIDERING THE DIFFICULTY OF THE OTHER MISSIONS, I EXPECT THAT YOU WILL MAKE SOME PROGRESS

253
27:09.362 --> 27:10.863
BUT NOT ENOUGH TO COMPLETE YOUR MISSION.

254
27:15.576 --> 27:20.456
THE KIDNAPPER IS JUST TOYING WITH YOU. PLEASE WORK WITH ME.

255
27:36.013 --> 27:39.809
SORRY, BUT I’M GOING TO PRIORITIZE WINNING THE GAME FOR MYSELF.

256
27:47.108 --> 27:51.612
I’M GRATEFUL FOR YOUR HELP. SORRY FOR TRICKING YOU

257
27:59.245 --> 28:03.207
LET ME KNOW IF YOU CHANGE YOUR MIND.

258
28:19.724 --> 28:24.603
Thank you, doctor. Thank you so much for agreeing to operate.

259
28:25.271 --> 28:27.815
I'll do my best.

260
28:29.358 --> 28:31.027
Thank you.

261
28:45.541 --> 28:48.502
I'm Han Kiju. I'll be your surgeon today.

262
28:49.253 --> 28:51.005
Thank you, Doctor.

263
28:51.380 --> 28:55.968
Could you, please... please save my father.

264
28:57.261 --> 28:59.680
I'll do my best.

265
29:01.072 --> 29:04.354
PM 12:36 KST

266
29:09.482 --> 29:11.067
Excuse me.

267
29:28.709 --> 29:31.363
-Hello, doctor. -Hello.

268
29:40.888 --> 29:45.309
I'll be performing decompression surgery on a recurrent brain tumor.

269
29:57.029 --> 30:00.908
Removing the portion invading the brain tissue.

270
30:08.874 --> 30:10.668
MISSION COMMIT MURDER.

271
30:19.677 --> 30:21.178
Doctor?

272
30:30.104 --> 30:31.897
Because of me...

273
30:34.817 --> 30:36.402
Is everything okay?

274
30:37.570 --> 30:38.612
The patient will die.

275
30:38.946 --> 30:41.365
Please... please save my father.

276
30:48.372 --> 30:52.042
My dad's job is saving people's lives.

277
30:52.543 --> 30:57.006
I want to become someone who can save people, just like him.

278
31:00.718 --> 31:06.474
I love how you're a doctor who saves people.

279
31:55.856 --> 31:58.692
-Thank you so much! -Thank you, sir.

280
32:28.097 --> 32:33.519
WOULD TAKING MY OWN LIFE FULFILL MY MISSION?

281
32:59.295 --> 33:02.006
PM 06:17 KST

282
33:12.766 --> 33:13.809
Excuse me. Sorry.

283
33:14.935 --> 33:17.438
Dr. Han, does he work here?

284
33:17.730 --> 33:20.399
Sorry, could you say that again?

285
33:20.524 --> 33:21.942
Doctor... Dr. Han.

286
33:23.736 --> 33:25.237
Ah, Director!

287
33:26.405 --> 33:30.784
Excuse me. I'm looking for Dr. Han Kiju.

288
33:30.909 --> 33:33.370
Are you a friend of Dr. Han?

289
33:33.495 --> 33:36.081
I'm with the Tokyo Metropolitan Police.

290
33:36.206 --> 33:42.087
I need to talk to Doctor Han Kiju about the kidnapping.

291
33:42.212 --> 33:45.466
Oh, Dr. Han just finished an operation and left.

292
33:46.258 --> 33:47.593
An operation?

293
33:47.718 --> 33:52.890
Yeah. It was a very difficult operation. But Dr. Han worked a miracle.

294
33:55.017 --> 33:56.644
The patient... survived?

295
33:56.769 --> 34:00.189
He did well despite the difficult situation.

296
34:01.106 --> 34:05.110
I will complete my mission and save Rian by any means possible.

297
34:06.654 --> 34:09.531
But it looks like it took a toll on him.

298
34:09.782 --> 34:13.494
He just left with a very tired look on his face.

299
34:15.037 --> 34:17.164
All right, thank you.

300
34:29.968 --> 34:32.221
RIAN RE: KIDNAP GAME

301
34:32.346 --> 34:35.891
YES.

302
34:50.739 --> 34:52.116
Dammit.

303
35:06.422 --> 35:07.256
You're her father!

304
35:07.840 --> 35:10.426
Rian was kidnapped in front of you!

305
36:40.974 --> 36:44.394
TAKE CARE OF RIAN FOR ME.

306
36:48.315 --> 36:50.567
You know, I can see it.

307
36:51.193 --> 36:55.489
No matter where, no matter when, I can see your smile, Dad.

308
37:13.423 --> 37:14.800
Don't do it!

309
37:20.180 --> 37:23.350
-Who the hell are you?! Let me go! -Calm down!

310
37:23.475 --> 37:25.394
Let me go!

311
37:31.650 --> 37:32.943
No!

312
37:34.278 --> 37:35.737
Let me go!

313
37:35.863 --> 37:37.948
I'm saving my daughter!

314
37:54.131 --> 37:57.634
You stay out of this!

315
37:57.843 --> 37:59.886
I'll kill you!

316
38:05.934 --> 38:07.394
Then do it!

317
38:08.937 --> 38:12.107
You can't! You can't kill anyone.

318
38:14.499 --> 38:16.000
It's not who you are!

319
38:17.140 --> 38:19.083
I have to save my daughter!

320
38:20.856 --> 38:25.662
I have to save her!

321
39:03.992 --> 39:08.288
I'm going to die and end this game...

322
39:08.956 --> 39:10.749
It's the only way.

323
39:11.249 --> 39:13.335
I can't let you do that.

324
39:16.254 --> 39:21.426
I'm part of this game, too.

325
39:25.555 --> 39:32.003
You just want to save your loved one, too.

326
39:33.855 --> 39:35.196
Sure, I want to save her.

327
39:37.651 --> 39:42.447
But Saori, my wife, she'd say...

328
39:45.742 --> 39:51.335
"It's not right to let someone like you die for a game like this."

329
40:01.508 --> 40:07.355
You always fought for people's lives,

330
40:11.018 --> 40:13.103
even if it seemed hopeless.

331
40:15.439 --> 40:19.443
Even today, you saved someone.

332
40:26.408 --> 40:27.534
No.

333
40:30.954 --> 40:35.792
I tried to kill him and failed.

334
40:35.917 --> 40:37.419
That's not true!

335
40:40.422 --> 40:46.910
You understand more than anyone how precious life is.

336
40:50.849 --> 40:58.729
That's why you're staking your own life to save your daughter.

337
41:04.654 --> 41:10.577
You're fighting for her without hurting or killing anybody.

338
41:17.417 --> 41:23.465
Do you want to prevail in this sick game?

339
41:32.849 --> 41:35.685
If one prevails...

340
41:39.856 --> 41:42.317
all the other lives are taken.

341
41:44.319 --> 41:46.696
Can you accept that?!

342
42:01.545 --> 42:04.963
I don't want any more people to die.

343
42:10.136 --> 42:11.555
Including my wife...

344
42:16.393 --> 42:18.145
and your daughter.

345
42:28.405 --> 42:29.739
I promise you...

346
42:31.992 --> 42:34.839
I'll save your daughter. I'll save everyone.

347
42:36.163 --> 42:36.696
But...

348
42:40.959 --> 42:42.203
I need your help.

349
42:56.558 --> 42:58.023
Are you trying to save them

350
42:59.936 --> 43:01.390
because you're a detective?

351
43:07.235 --> 43:09.112
Do you save people

352
43:11.364 --> 43:13.241
because you're a doctor?

353
43:17.787 --> 43:19.122
That's not why.

354
43:51.529 --> 43:52.864
Thanks.

355
43:55.492 --> 43:58.323
You speak Japanese.

356
44:01.373 --> 44:03.363
I worked in Japan for a while.

357
44:06.044 --> 44:07.295
I see.

358
44:10.715 --> 44:13.260
-Which part... -How will you save everyone?

359
44:16.429 --> 44:17.931
I don't know.

360
44:19.849 --> 44:24.609
That's why I need information to track down the mastermind.

361
44:27.440 --> 44:32.445
Nothing comes to mind.

362
44:35.282 --> 44:37.200
Any information would help.

363
44:40.578 --> 44:41.830
Do you know him?

364
44:42.747 --> 44:45.476
He was in Japan, but spoke Korean.

365
44:50.338 --> 44:51.548
No.

366
44:53.633 --> 44:55.176
Okay...

367
44:59.097 --> 45:05.270
But there must be common factors linking you, me, and the other players.

368
45:08.606 --> 45:12.235
Sorry... I'm not going to be much use.

369
45:12.360 --> 45:17.991
It's fine. I still need your help. I can trust you.

370
45:26.875 --> 45:34.007
I failed my family and I failed my patients.

371
45:39.929 --> 45:43.600
I've failed as a husband and a police officer...

372
45:47.354 --> 45:49.939
I put my wife through hell

373
45:52.567 --> 45:55.195
and screwed up as a detective...

374
45:59.949 --> 46:02.911
It's my fault this happened to her.

375
46:06.081 --> 46:08.083
So I've got to save her.

376
46:11.419 --> 46:15.173
If you save your wife, my daughter will die.

377
46:15.507 --> 46:17.675
I'll save your daughter, too.

378
46:20.220 --> 46:23.181
I still don't know if I can trust you.

379
46:28.937 --> 46:31.356
If I ever double-cross you...

380
46:33.983 --> 46:41.074
then... kill me and complete your mission.

381
46:57.298 --> 46:58.883
What will you do next?

382
47:01.344 --> 47:02.830
I'll meet the other players.

383
47:04.889 --> 47:06.583
Find the common factors.

384
47:09.686 --> 47:11.646
Taipei's a good start.

385
47:12.772 --> 47:14.774
Taipei? Why?

386
47:15.733 --> 47:19.195
I have a feeling I've met her before.

387
47:20.321 --> 47:22.282
The hostage's wife.

388
47:22.407 --> 47:23.366
TAIPEI

389
47:39.924 --> 47:42.135
Are you in the kiDnap GAME?

390
47:43.761 --> 47:45.263
What do you mean...?

391
47:46.097 --> 47:48.984
Don't keep secrets. Dad's life is at stake.

392
47:51.019 --> 47:52.550
I'm not keeping secrets.

393
47:55.356 --> 47:56.608
Liar.

394
48:00.820 --> 48:05.158
Where... When... I don't know.

395
48:07.118 --> 48:09.287
But I know her face.

396
48:11.873 --> 48:14.918
That's the first link between the players.

397
48:18.463 --> 48:19.476
Come with me.

398
48:23.134 --> 48:24.383
Let me think about it.

399
48:29.182 --> 48:30.558
All right.

400
48:33.353 --> 48:35.410
I'll fly to Taipei in the morning.

401
48:37.232 --> 48:38.729
Come when you've decided.

402
51:40.748 --> 51:43.042
My Dear Ayun. I'm sorry.

403
51:44.419 --> 51:47.755
I can't bring myself to kill.

404
51:49.674 --> 51:54.137
The rules of the game allow only one to survive.

405
51:55.680 --> 51:57.724
If I kill someone,

406
51:58.766 --> 52:02.186
every hostage except Rian dies.

407
52:03.688 --> 52:09.735
As a father, I know it's right to save her at any cost.

408
52:09.861 --> 52:10.987
But

409
52:13.030 --> 52:15.158
I'm not capable of murder.

410
52:27.587 --> 52:28.588
I'm waiting.

411
52:31.007 --> 52:32.175
Hopefully...

412
52:33.301 --> 52:34.761
he'll show up.

413
52:36.137 --> 52:37.430
If he doesn't?

414
52:38.514 --> 52:39.974
Then I'll go alone.

415
52:41.142 --> 52:43.535
I need to put a stop to this game.

416
52:45.605 --> 52:48.816
Think how it tormented the man in Manila

417
52:49.484 --> 52:52.528
and the woman in Bangkok.

418
52:55.948 --> 52:58.868
How it nearly drove Kiju to suicide.

419
53:03.998 --> 53:05.333
I know.

420
53:06.209 --> 53:12.465
This is the final boarding call for Flight 4321 to Taipei...

421
53:13.049 --> 53:14.884
Guess he's not coming.

422
53:15.384 --> 53:16.802
Take care.

423
53:16.928 --> 53:17.970
I will.

424
53:35.655 --> 53:37.323
Wait!

425
53:52.922 --> 53:54.173
That's why...

426
53:55.424 --> 53:57.260
I'm going to save Rian.

427
53:59.470 --> 54:03.850
We'll save the other hostages and end the game.

428
54:07.520 --> 54:11.774
So we can see Rian in joy.

429
54:13.442 --> 54:19.657
So we can be a family of three again.

430
54:59.822 --> 55:01.449
Thanks for coming.

431
55:02.783 --> 55:03.951
It's nothing.

432
55:06.203 --> 55:07.705
One condition...

433
55:09.874 --> 55:14.378
If you double-cross me, I will absolutely kill you.

434
55:16.589 --> 55:20.217
If I do, then kill me. But...

435
55:22.094 --> 55:24.221
that's not going to happen.

436
55:29.518 --> 55:35.045
I can't just take your word for it.

437
55:37.693 --> 55:41.240
But I want to believe in your ideals.

438
55:42.156 --> 55:45.346
So I'll go with you.

439
55:52.375 --> 55:53.108
Thanks.

440
56:10.559 --> 56:17.108
"What are you prioritizing over the lives of your loved ones?

441
56:18.859 --> 56:25.658
"You are on a fool's errand... Carry out your missions immediately."

442
56:45.177 --> 56:46.011
We have to go.

443
57:04.632 --> 57:08.381
5 DAYS AND 11 HOURS UNTIL THE GAME ENDS.
